{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"better\":\"Y\",\"regress\":\"有，Y的音乐感受描写明显不如X细腻，尤其缺少X那种对节奏、半音、音区、音型变化及具体音乐瞬间的精确捕捉，部分感受容易变成笼统的情绪标签。\",\"nets\":{\"scan\":\"Y\",\"point\":\"Y\",\"why\":\"Y\",\"whole\":\"Y\",\"fine\":\"X\"},\"why\":\"作为没读过原文、同时还在听音乐的普通观众，Y的叙述更完整，人物每一步为什么动摇、为什么怀念、为什么不回头，都能顺着读下来，前后情绪转折也更容易理解。X的音乐感受明显更丰富、更具体，而且有些描述能精确对应音乐瞬间，但信息密度和碎片数量较大，容易让人忙于扫词而顾不上理解故事。总体我选Y，因为它更容易让观众真正理解这个人的经历和选择；但X在音乐感受的细腻程度上有明显优势。 \"}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "aaac8ba1-9608-4bc2-97c0-3bed02d7175e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T172517963444Z", "elapsed_seconds": 71.672, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T17:26:29.640088+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "37b2bcf3531222678eae34441a75ea91d0ca814ce5190fb281ec0ea13c190b2e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa2388500002570